the two strict Arctic retained-land additions proposed in PR #1533 through the selected native bank and normal application consumers. The qualified change adds 140 cells to CAN-15:NWT and one cell to CAN-25:NUN, with no prior cell removal or reassignment. The 49,623 other complete records, including the previous Quebec/Newfoundland repairs, remain unchanged.\n\nRefs #1520\n\nOrdinary builds authenticate an independently reviewed immutable artifact certificate and the selected geometry/native/release products. They use a new private application-consumption identity and retain the three literal metadata associations. Existing V2 scientific validators, their private brands, original methods and historical code banks remain unchanged. The completed scientific runs are reused through full source, operating, publication and output custody; rebuilding the application does not rerun them.\n\nThe selected v9 bank retains all 56 complete native members: 54 original compressed bodies and two qualified replacements. Fresh outputs preserve the original v8 startup URLs and emit successor startup assets in the namespace bound to the selected manifest hash. The complete 84,833 release memberships and historical records are retained. Classification assets keep their original physical classes while their ownership association is explicitly rebound to the selected release, footprint and grid.\n\nThe source-eligible third component remains unactivated because strict construction failed. Four other candidates remain source-rule failures. Historical source-area cache values remain exact; the current recomputation's one-ULP mismatch and unknown historical runtime are explicit limits. No tolerance, scientific method or declared resource bound is relaxed. Production deployment remains deferred.\n\nIndependent certificate acceptance is posted at issue #1520 comment 6079096820 and its whole API receipt is pinned in the selected route. All 171 qualified original invocations and complete operating custody are retained. The reviewed compact catalogue declares all 343 complete release products; the consumer and installer authenticate their whole encoded and decoded pins. The expanded roster contains 480 roles. Actual installer controls reject ten malformed product rosters before opening bodies. Two fresh normal hosted builds, complete output/consumer readback and final exact-head review remain required before normal merge.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-09T09:49:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T10:31:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8dba463474ac2cae17f9007bc75ce4503a966545","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ChengshuLi:engineering/arctic-three-retained-land-fit-repair-native-20261008","ref":"engineering/arctic-three-retained-land-fit-repair-native-20261008","repo":{"id":1398904968,"node_id":"R_kgDOU2GYiA","name":"WorldAtlas","full_name":"ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas","owner":{"login":"ChengshuLi","id":6732996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzI5OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6732996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi","html_url":"https://github.com/ChengshuLi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":